# Hosts the sandbox may reach through the egress proxy, one per line.
# Exact names; a leading "*." also allows subdomains. The configured LLM
# provider's host is added by run-sandboxed.sh. Extra hosts: X0NE_SANDBOX_ALLOW.
crates.io
index.crates.io
static.crates.io
pypi.org
files.pythonhosted.org
deb.debian.org
github.com
codeload.github.com
objects.githubusercontent.com
# WebSearch first backend: Exa public MCP endpoint, receives the query, no key.
mcp.exa.ai
